      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE introduces a new**2026 Pre-Fall Stripes**collection this week, featuring natural linen-colored cotton canvas as the backdrop. The highlight is the vibrant multicolored stripes embroidered across the bags, with diagonal textures creating a fluid visual rhythm and striking contrasts that exude artistic appeal.",
